@startuml
title daily_work — sequence
actor "maker" as U
participant "web_app" as S_0
participant "project_store" as S_1
participant "tool_workers" as S_2
participant "tang_nano" as S_3
== reopen (use) ==
U -> S_0 : project_list, save_status
U -> S_1 : project_list, save_status
note right of U : emotion 4/5
== edit (use) ==
U -> S_0 : editor, pin_table
note right of U : emotion 4/5 — pain: ピン割り当てとコードが別の場所にある
== build (use) ==
U -> S_0 : build_progress, build_summary
U -> S_2 : build_progress, build_summary
note right of U : emotion 3/5
== fix_errors (recover) ==
U -> S_0 : problem_list, editor
note right of U : emotion 2/5 — pain: ログが長く、問題の行へ移れない, 古い成果物を書き込んでしまう
== verify (use) ==
U -> S_0 : sim_run, waveform, formal_run
U -> S_2 : sim_run, waveform, formal_run
note right of U : emotion 3/5 — pain: 設定が左の列の奥にあり見つけにくい
== write (use) ==
U -> S_0 : write_progress, write_result
U -> S_3 : write_progress, write_result
note right of U : emotion 4/5
== share (exit) ==
U -> S_0 : zip_export
U -> S_1 : zip_export
note right of U : emotion 4/5
@enduml
